# Force subscribe / auth
# Format: channel IDs starting with -100, separated by SPACES (not commas).
#   A comma makes that ID invalid and it is silently ignored.
# The bot must be admin (with "Invite users" permission) in every channel listed.
# Limit: no hard limit in code; Telegram allows max 100 buttons per message.
#   Each channel = 1 check + 1 new invite link per user request, so more channels = slower replies.
#   Recommended: AUTH_CHANNELS max 4, AUTH_REQ_CHANNELS max 2 (6 total).
# AUTH_CHANNELS     = user must actually join.
# AUTH_REQ_CHANNELS = user only needs to send a join request (good for private channels).
AUTH_REQ_CHANNELS=-1001234567890 -1009876543210
AUTH_CHANNELS=-1001234567890 -1009876543210

